# community-web.rules: SINH TỰ ĐỘNG, KHÔNG sửa tay (sửa sẽ bị ghi đè khi chạy lại bộ chuyển đổi).
# Nguồn: data/rules/upstream/community.rules (Snort Community Ruleset, GPLv2, bản quyền Sourcefire/Cisco và các tác giả).
# Đã chuyển sang cú pháp Snort 3 của engine, rule dùng option chưa hỗ trợ đã bị loại.
# Sinh lại: python -m tools.rules.snort2_convert

alert tcp $EXTERNAL_NET 80 -> $HOME_NET any (msg:"BROWSER-OTHER Netscape 4.7 client overflow"; flow:to_client,established; content:"3|C9 B1 10|?|E9 06|Q<|FA|G3|C0|P|F7 D0|P"; reference:bugtraq,822; reference:cve,1999-1189; reference:cve,2000-1187; classtype:attempted-user; priority:1; sid:283; rev:14;)
alert tcp $HOME_NET any -> $EXTERNAL_NET 80 (msg:"BROWSER-OTHER Netscape 4.7 unsucessful overflow"; flow:to_server,established; content:"3|C9 B1 10|?|E9 06|Q<|FA|G3|C0|P|F7 D0|P"; reference:bugtraq,822; reference:cve,1999-1189; reference:cve,2000-1187; classtype:unsuccessful-user; priority:1; sid:311; rev:15;)
alert tcp $EXTERNAL_NET any -> $HTTP_SERVERS $HTTP_PORTS (msg:"SERVER-WEBAPP PCCS mysql database admin tool access"; flow:to_server,established; content:"pccsmysqladm/incs/dbconnect.inc",nocase,depth 36; service:http; reference:bugtraq,1557; reference:cve,2000-0707; reference:nessus,10783; classtype:web-application-attack; priority:1; sid:509; rev:18;)
alert tcp $EXTERNAL_NET any -> $HTTP_SERVERS $HTTP_PORTS (msg:"SERVER-WEBAPP HyperSeek hsx.cgi directory traversal attempt"; flow:to_server,established; http_uri; content:"/hsx.cgi"; content:"../../"; content:"%00",distance 1; service:http; reference:bugtraq,2314; reference:cve,2001-0253; reference:nessus,10602; classtype:web-application-attack; priority:1; sid:803; rev:21;)
alert tcp $EXTERNAL_NET any -> $HTTP_SERVERS $HTTP_PORTS (msg:"SERVER-WEBAPP SWSoft ASPSeek Overflow attempt"; flow:to_server,established; http_uri; content:"/s.cgi",nocase,fast_pattern; content:"tmpl="; service:http; reference:bugtraq,2492; reference:cve,2001-0476; classtype:web-application-attack; priority:1; sid:804; rev:20;)
alert tcp $EXTERNAL_NET any -> $HTTP_SERVERS $HTTP_PORTS (msg:"SERVER-WEBAPP Progress webspeed access"; flow:to_server,established; http_uri; content:"/wsisa.dll/WService=",nocase,fast_pattern; content:"WSMadmin",nocase; service:http; reference:bugtraq,969; reference:cve,2000-0127; reference:nessus,10304; classtype:attempted-user; priority:1; sid:805; rev:22;)
